{
  "note": "A squid out of its element, hauled up into a drowned hold. The mantle is a cone pointing back over it, the eyes are the whole of the face, and the arms are eight boxes that wave whether it is moving or not — which is what makes it read as a squid rather than as a lump with eyes.",
